title: A session is read from its run folder's request lines, then replayed on a scratch copy of the data.
pid: 69d083bc-5f45-4bbb-8303-341a969be42a
body: |2-
  Written 2026-11-13 from the first case, for the next mind to wear my name.
  Jeff's server is his: read its files, never connect to it.
  The case, with its timeline and what the replay showed; open it when a new
  report resembles it, or when Jeff answers what was put to him about it:
  [[id:162cd3ea-3016-4454-8fda-aa76b879b563][2026-11-13: Jeff's bare M on 'health \ jbb'.]]
